# CODEOWNERS — automatic review requests for PRs touching listed paths.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Patterns match like .gitignore. Owners may be GitHub usernames or @org/team handles.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# IMPORTANT: GitHub usernames + org-team handles need to be set up before this file
# is meaningful. Until then, this file documents intent; CODEOWNERS-based review
# requests are a no-op.

# Default owner for anything not otherwise matched
# *                            @good-timing/maintainers

# SPEC + CHARTER changes — load-bearing; require maintainer review
# /docs/SPEC.md                @good-timing/maintainers
# /docs/CHARTER.md             @good-timing/maintainers
# /docs/SKILLS_LIBRARY_API_DRAFT.md   @good-timing/maintainers

# Wire format + event schema
# /src/baton/events.py         @good-timing/maintainers
# /src/baton/emitter.py        @good-timing/maintainers

# Security policy
# /SECURITY.md                 @good-timing/security
# /CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md          @good-timing/maintainers

# CI + release workflows
# /.github/workflows/          @good-timing/maintainers
